  dialogue:
  - Welcome, young warrior. Before I entrust you with an important package, you must
    prove yourself.
  - 'Good. Use the dash attack by equipping it (1) then right-click to dash-attack. '
  - 'Come back when you are ready.  '
  - Now go to the second dojo and defeat every fighter there.
  - 'Show me your strength, and I will reward you with a Red Packet.   '
